    "body": "Moved from #35302 due to https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35302#issuecomment-7126751401.\n\nThis PR:\n- refactors `CreateRateBumpTransaction` to return a `util::Expected` of a Result and Error Struct instead of using out params.  This change makes it easier for #35302 to add a sp_recipients field to the Result Struct instead of adding a new output parameter.\n- rejects an `original_change_index` that specifies an output without a destination. The pre-existing behaviour silently replaced the specified output if an `OP_RETURN` output was specified.",
